{1 = 1-14}
11.	How many there are! How many cows there are! 
12.	How many cattle of @wDN{Suen} there are! 
13.	The dark ones are translucent lapis lazuli; 
14.	the pale cows are the light of the risen moon. 
15.	The little ones trickle down like barleycorns for you; 
16.	the large ones throng together like wild bulls for you. 
17.	The Glory of Heaven @noteref{Suen} has undone the halters of the numerous cows in his teeming herd. 
18.	He has poured out milk from the beautiful cows at the offering table; 
19.	his bright hands ever pour the milk. 
110.	After my king has completed the work, 
111.	@wDN{Suen} …… the shining halter …… the cows, 
112.	he …… the cows, 
113.	he …… the cows. 
114.	He acts as the herder of the cows. 

{15 = 15-20}
1515.	His own mother, the lady of @wSN{Nibru}, 
1516.	speaks a prayer to the lord in his desert: 
1517.	@q[Ninlil,Nanna]{“A prayer, O shepherd! A prayer! 
1518.	May the cows be numerous for you in the good desert. 
1519.	When you arrive at nightfall, may you renew the @wTN{E-kur}, 
1520.	the highly prized sanctuary.”} 

{21 = 21-24}
2121.	He is its lover, he is its lover, 
2122.	he is the lord, the @wTN{E-kur's} lover! 
2123.	He is the man of delight to @wDN{Enlil}, 
2124.	he is @wDN{Suen}, the cry of joy of his own mother. 

{25 = 25-36}
2525.	The mother who bore him speaks kindly from her loving heart to @wDN{Suen}: 
2526.	@q[Ninlil,Suen]{“You are the beloved of the heart who calms the heart, 
2527.	@wDN{Suen}, 
2528.	shining calf who grew fat on the holy lap; 
2529.	you can wish in your heart for anything! 
2530.	You can desire everything precious to the heart! 
2531.	……, splendour of the @wTN{E-kur}, 
2532.	make your wish on @wDN{Enlil's} lap. May you create glory in heaven! 
2533.	May the @wTN{E-kur} sing a song of joy about you, 
2534.	may the people call upon your life, 
2535.	@wDN{Suen}, 
2536.	may you be supreme in heaven and earth!”} 

{37 = 37-40}
3737.	He has poured out milk from the …… cows at the offering table, 
3738.	@wDN{Suen} has ordained the purification rites: 
3739.	@q[Suen,self]{“Everything that I do is brilliant! 
3740.	My father @wDN{Enlil} has fed me well.”} 

{41 = 41-49}
4141.	His mother speaks kindly in joy to the king, 
4142.	the holy barge which travels across the sky: 
4143.	@q[Ninlil,Nanna]{“My wild bull whom @wDN{An} has well called, 
4144.	your name is respected in all lands. 
4145.	Lord of the holy herd who consecrates the purification rites, 
4146.	seed engendered in a holy shrine, shining halter, 
4147.	heroic child born by @wDN{Ninlil}! @wDN{Nanna}, 
4148.	seed engendered in the fields, beloved of holy @wDN{An}! 
4149.	@wDN{An} has conferred on you the shepherding of the Land!”} 

{50 = 50-60}
5050.	@q{“@wDN{Enlil} has named you with a good renown -- you are the son of @wDN{Enlil} whose speech is just. 
5051.	In his elevated heart @wDN{An} has bestowed kingship on you. 
5052.	He has chosen your city @wSN{Urim} in his heart. 
5053.	For you he has brought fish and birds to the princely river. 
5054.	First-born of @wDN{Enlil}, who …… the rank of lord, 
5055.	he has bestowed on you the kingship of heaven. 
5056.	You are a god dressed in beauty in the heavens. 
5057.	Your moonlight is holy and bright, 
5058.	and because like @wDN{Utu} you are a shepherd of the Land, 
5059.	@wDN{Nanna}, 
5060.	it shines forth for the king like the daylight.”} 

